- [ ] Verify source account balance is reduced by $100 after successful transfer.
- [ ] Verify destination account balance is increased by $100 after successful transfer.
- [ ] Verify transfer is declined when source account has insufficient funds.
- [ ] Verify error message "Insufficient funds" is displayed when transfer is declined.
- [ ] Verify source account balance remains unchanged when transfer is declined.
- [ ] Verify destination account balance remains unchanged when transfer is declined.
- [ ] Verify transfer is declined when attempting to transfer funds to the same account.
- [ ] Verify error message "Cannot transfer to the same account" is displayed when transfer is declined.
- [ ] Verify account balance remains unchanged when transfer to the same account is declined.

