    Given the photo "photo123" is not marked as sent
    When the archivist sends the photo "photo123" to the researcher "researcherA"
    Then the photo "photo123" should be marked as sent to "researcherA"

  Scenario: Archivist checks if a photo has been sent to a researcher
    Given the photo "photo123" is marked as sent to "researcherA"
    When the archivist checks if the photo "photo123" has been sent to "researcherA"
    Then the system should confirm that the photo "photo123" has been sent to "researcherA"

  Scenario: Archivist sends a photo to a researcher that has already been sent
